{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Interpreted the snapshot-repair receipt: the wedged node stayed at store 1..2 with certificate (4,2) and commit 2 before the phase, then after the leader's compaction-driven InstallSnapshot its store became 6..6, certificate (6,3) and commit 6 with the post-snapshot entry stored; the repair predicate holds and the repair set {restart, snapshot install} is now executed, while the wedge defect remains asserted.\"}"}}
